{"version":2,"slug":"how-native-speakers-actually-flirt","videoId":"NTEIyElkpxs","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/NTEIyElkpxs","lang":"en","title":"How native speakers ACTUALLY flirt","category":"Daily life","channel":"Miss Honey 🍯","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@Slow_English_Podcast","captionSource":"auto","tags":["English Conversation","learn english"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Have you ever wanted to flirt in"},{"start":4,"text":"English, but were too afraid"},{"start":9,"text":"of sounding"},{"start":11,"text":"awkward?"},{"start":12,"text":"Today,"},{"start":13,"text":"I'm going to teach you"},{"start":16,"text":"what native speakers"},{"start":20,"text":"actually say, what they definitely"},{"start":25,"text":"don't say, and"},{"start":28,"text":"at the end,"},{"start":30,"text":"we'll practice a real conversation"},{"start":35,"text":"together. Let's start"},{"start":38,"text":"with what to say"},{"start":40,"text":"versus what not to say."},{"start":44,"text":"Instead of trying to impress someone,"},{"start":50,"text":"just start a real conversation"},{"start":54,"text":"with them. You can shadow along with me."},{"start":58,"text":"Hi."},{"start":59,"text":"Is anyone sitting there?"},{"start":62,"text":"Or,"},{"start":64,"text":"I like your jacket."},{"start":67,"text":"You could follow up with,"},{"start":69,"text":"Where did you get it?"},{"start":71,"text":"I've been wanting to try that coffee."},{"start":75,"text":"So, what do you do?"},{"start":78,"text":"Where are you from?"},{"start":80,"text":"How do you know everyone here?"},{"start":84,"text":"Flirting starts with a conversation,"},{"start":88,"text":"a natural conversation, not with"},{"start":93,"text":"Did it hurt when you fell from heaven?"},{"start":97,"text":"Don't say that. Haha."},{"start":99,"text":"Are you a magician?"},{"start":102,"text":"Because when I look at you, everything"},{"start":105,"text":"else disappears."},{"start":108,"text":"Please, don't say that."},{"start":110,"text":"Maybe if you're trying to make someone"},{"start":114,"text":"laugh,"},{"start":116,"text":"it makes sense to say those pick up"},{"start":120,"text":"lines."},{"start":121,"text":"Most native speakers know these lines."},{"start":126,"text":"But nobody actually uses them"},{"start":130,"text":"seriously."},{"start":131,"text":"Now, compliments that sound"},{"start":135,"text":"natural."},{"start":136,"text":"Instead of saying,"},{"start":139,"text":"\"You're beautiful.\""},{"start":142,"text":"Try saying,"},{"start":144,"text":"\"You have a great smile.\""},{"start":147,"text":"\"I love your laugh.\""},{"start":149,"text":"\"I think you're really interesting.\""},{"start":153,"text":"\"You look really nice.\""},{"start":157,"text":"Or"},{"start":158,"text":"if you want to sound more"},{"start":162,"text":"friendly,"},{"start":163,"text":"not so romantic,"},{"start":166,"text":"you can say,"},{"start":168,"text":"\"You're really easy to talk to.\""},{"start":172,"text":"\"I like your style.\""},{"start":175,"text":"\"You seem really fun.\""},{"start":179,"text":"\"You have good taste.\""},{"start":183,"text":"It could be taste in music, taste"},{"start":187,"text":"in clothing, taste in art, depending on"},{"start":191,"text":"the situation. Now,"},{"start":193,"text":"some common mistakes"},{"start":197,"text":"in casual conversations."},{"start":200,"text":"\"I want to know you.\""},{"start":203,"text":"\"I'd like to get to know you.\""},{"start":206,"text":"\"You are very good.\""},{"start":210,"text":"\"You look great.\""},{"start":212,"text":"Or \"You look very nice today.\""},{"start":216,"text":"Today I opened the Slow English"},{"start":218,"text":"community, and I just wanted to say a"},{"start":220,"text":"huge thanks to everyone who's joined."},{"start":223,"text":"I'm so excited to meet all of you,"},{"start":226,"text":"to hear all of your stories, and to"},{"start":228,"text":"watch you grow over the next few months."},{"start":231,"text":"One of my favorite parts isn't teaching."},{"start":233,"text":"It's getting to know you and seeing how"},{"start":236,"text":"your confidence grows every week. If"},{"start":239,"text":"you've been thinking about joining, the"},{"start":240,"text":"community's only open for 1 week."},{"start":243,"text":"Can't wait to meet you."},{"start":244,"text":"I'm boring."},{"start":247,"text":"What you actually mean is I am bored."},{"start":251,"text":"If you say I am boring, you're saying"},{"start":255,"text":"that you make other people feel"},{"start":259,"text":"bored."},{"start":260,"text":"That you are boring."},{"start":263,"text":"But if you are bored,"},{"start":266,"text":"then that's the feeling"},{"start":268,"text":"of being bored."},{"start":270,"text":"I want to know you."},{"start":273,"text":"I'd like to get to know you."},{"start":276,"text":"Most native speakers never say I want to"},{"start":279,"text":"know you."},{"start":280,"text":"Can I know your name?"},{"start":283,"text":"What's your name?"},{"start":286,"text":"Give me your number."},{"start":288,"text":"Sounds too demanding."},{"start":290,"text":"Ask."},{"start":292,"text":"Can I have your number?"},{"start":294,"text":"I like very much your smile."},{"start":298,"text":"I really like your smile. Or you have a"},{"start":302,"text":"beautiful smile."},{"start":304,"text":"You're very sympathetic."},{"start":307,"text":"You're very nice."},{"start":309,"text":"You're very friendly."},{"start":311,"text":"It's not the same as it is in Spanish."},{"start":316,"text":"Not the same."},{"start":317,"text":"We can be friends."},{"start":320,"text":"Do you want to be friends? Or"},{"start":323,"text":"we should hang out sometime."},{"start":326,"text":"I have 25 years old."},{"start":330,"text":"I am 25 years old."},{"start":334,"text":"Or"},{"start":334.6,"text":"I am 25."},{"start":336,"text":"I am agree."},{"start":339,"text":"I agree."},{"start":340,"text":"I'm searching a girlfriend."},{"start":344,"text":"I'm looking for a girlfriend. or"},{"start":347,"text":"I'm single."},{"start":350,"text":"I have girlfriend."},{"start":352,"text":"I have a girlfriend."},{"start":356,"text":"I fell in love with you."},{"start":359,"text":"If you just met, that's too intense."},{"start":363,"text":"I would start with something like"},{"start":365,"text":"I think you're really interesting."},{"start":368,"text":"Or I'd love to get to know you better."},{"start":372,"text":"I am exciting."},{"start":375,"text":"I am excited."},{"start":378,"text":"Exciting causes excitement."},{"start":382,"text":"Excited is the feeling. I'm so"},{"start":385,"text":"embarrassing."},{"start":387,"text":"I'm so embarrassed. I like very much"},{"start":391,"text":"this place."},{"start":393,"text":"How is called this?"},{"start":397,"text":"What is this called? I have hungry."},{"start":402,"text":"I am hungry."},{"start":404,"text":"Now, let's see what you remember. I want"},{"start":407,"text":"to know you."},{"start":409,"text":"What would you say instead?"},{"start":412,"text":"I'd like to get to know you. Perfect."},{"start":415,"text":"Give me your number."},{"start":418,"text":"No, they wouldn't. What would they say"},{"start":420,"text":"instead?"},{"start":422,"text":"Can I get your number?"},{"start":425,"text":"Now, some phrases that native speakers"},{"start":427,"text":"use that just sound natural."},{"start":431,"text":"I'd love to see you again."},{"start":433,"text":"I had a really good time today."},{"start":437,"text":"We should do this again sometime."},{"start":440,"text":"Let me know when you're free."},{"start":443,"text":"Text me when you get home."},{"start":446,"text":"These sound warm"},{"start":448,"text":"without being over the top."},{"start":452,"text":"Intense."},{"start":453,"text":"All right, now let's practice together."},{"start":457,"text":"You're meeting someone at the coffee"},{"start":459,"text":"shop. Ready?"},{"start":464,"text":"Nope. Go ahead."},{"start":470,"text":"Thanks."},{"start":472,"text":"I'm actually a graphic designer."},{"start":478,"text":"Mostly branding on social media."},{"start":481,"text":"It's a lot of fun."},{"start":483,"text":"What about you?"},{"start":487,"text":"Nice."},{"start":488,"text":"So, what brings you here today?"},{"start":496,"text":"I know the feeling."},{"start":498,"text":"I come here when I need to focus."},{"start":504,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":505,"text":"That's a really nice compliment."},{"start":512,"text":"I love to."},{"start":516,"text":"Of course."},{"start":517,"text":"Did you notice that nobody said,"},{"start":521,"text":"\"Did it hurt when you fell from heaven?\""},{"start":524,"text":"We just had a normal conversation."},{"start":528,"text":"That's how flirting works in English."},{"start":531,"text":"You ask questions, you show interest,"},{"start":534,"text":"you give compliments,"},{"start":536,"text":"and most of all, you're respectful,"},{"start":538,"text":"right?"},{"start":539,"text":"I think it's interesting that we all"},{"start":542,"text":"have different ways to flirt."},{"start":546,"text":"I think it's a big part of learning a"},{"start":549,"text":"language"},{"start":551,"text":"that most people don't talk about."},{"start":555,"text":"These phrases and tips"},{"start":558,"text":"can even be used for making friends,"},{"start":562,"text":"having a friendly conversation."},{"start":565,"text":"I don't believe you need to be so"},{"start":568,"text":"intense"},{"start":569,"text":"when you're trying to get to know"},{"start":571,"text":"someone"},{"start":572,"text":"or"},{"start":574,"text":"when you're attracted to someone."},{"start":577,"text":"If you just start a conversation with"},{"start":580,"text":"them"},{"start":581,"text":"and treat them like your equal."},{"start":584,"text":"Like you're just two normal human beings"},{"start":589,"text":"looking to make a connection."},{"start":592,"text":"Not necessarily romantic."},{"start":596,"text":"Just human."},{"start":598,"text":"Show respect."},{"start":601,"text":"Show humility."},{"start":604,"text":"And show your real authentic self."},{"start":608,"text":"Practice these a couple of times before"},{"start":611,"text":"you go out to socialize this week."},{"start":614,"text":"I hope you make some meaningful"},{"start":617,"text":"connections."},{"start":618,"text":"And have fun this week."},{"start":620,"text":"[music]"},{"start":621,"text":"Don't forget to like if you want a part"},{"start":623,"text":"two."},{"start":625,"text":"And subscribe to learn English with me"},{"start":627,"text":"every week."},{"start":628,"text":"I'll see you guys next Wednesday."},{"start":631,"text":"Bye."},{"start":639,"text":"[music]"}]}